{"id":"0121a825a0af0100","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Parity Game","display":"df-zfc-game4-parity-game — ZFC Game4 Parity Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-parity-game — ZFC Game4 Parity Game","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-parity-game — ZFC Game4 Parity Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,V,V_0,V_1,E,\\Omega,W_0,\\pi\\in V\">\\(G,V,V_0,V_1,E,\\Omega,W_0,\\pi\\in V\\)</span> (arena code, positions, edge relation, priority map, winning set, and play)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (natural-number ordinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ParityGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ParityGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}parity\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ParityGame}_S(G,\\Omega,W_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V,V_0,V_1,E\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\langle V,V_0,V_1,E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land V\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land V_0\\cup V_1=V\n\\land V_0\\cap V_1=\\varnothing\n\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\n\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\exists w\\in V\\;(\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,V,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land W_0=\n\\Bigl\\{\\pi\\in V^\\omega:\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle\\pi(n),\\pi(n+1)\\rangle\\in E)\n\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(k=2m)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\land\\Omega(\\pi(n))=k\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall j\\in k\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\Omega(\\pi(n))\\neq j\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}parity\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ParityGame}_S(G,\\Omega,W_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V,V_0,V_1,E\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\langle V,V_0,V_1,E\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land V\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land V_0\\cup V_1=V\n\\land V_0\\cap V_1=\\varnothing\n\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\n\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\exists w\\in V\\;(\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,V,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land W_0=\n\\Bigl\\{\\pi\\in V^\\omega:\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle\\pi(n),\\pi(n+1)\\rangle\\in E)\n\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(k=2m)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\land\\Omega(\\pi(n))=k\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall j\\in k\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\Omega(\\pi(n))\\neq j\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The arena is total, so every play is infinite. The winning convention is min-parity: the least priority occurring infinitely often is even.</li>\n<li>Finiteness of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega)\\)</span> guarantees that every infinite play has an infinitely recurring priority.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega$ (natural-number ordinal, see [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,V,V_0,V_1,E,\\Omega,W_0,\\pi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ParityGame}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}parity\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame4ParityGame}_S(G,\\Omega,W_0)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V,V_0,V_1,E\\;\\Bigl(\nG=\\langle V,V_0,V_1,E\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land V\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land V_0\\cup V_1=V\n\\land V_0\\cap V_1=\\varnothing\n\\land E\\subseteq V\\times V\n\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;\\exists w\\in V\\;(\\langle v,w\\rangle\\in E)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Omega,V,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land W_0=\n\\Bigl\\{\\pi\\in V^\\omega:\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle\\pi(n),\\pi(n+1)\\rangle\\in E)\n\\land\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;(k=2m)\\\\\n&\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\land\\Omega(\\pi(n))=k\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{36mm}\\land\\forall j\\in k\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(N\\leq n\\to\\Omega(\\pi(n))\\neq j\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(\\Omega)","display":false}],"bytes":2080,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game.md|58-df-zfc-game4-parity-game]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5045d216c83e75cb","07554a796c3aa1f5"]}